{"info": {"address1": "Marathon Futurex", "address2": "Unit No. A-2501, A-Wing, 25th Floor Mafatlal Mills Compound N.M. Joshi Marg, Lower Parel (East)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400013", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6234 3000", "fax": "91 22 2300 2036", "website": "https://www.cdslindia.com", "industry": "Capital Markets", "industryKey": "capital-markets", "industryDisp": "Capital Markets", "sector": "Financial Services", "sectorKey": "financial-services", "sectorDisp": "Financial Services", "longBusinessSummary": "Central Depository Services (India) Limited, together with its subsidiaries, provides depository services in India. It operates through Depository; Data Entry and Storage; and Repository segments. The Depository segment offers various services to investors, such as dematerialisation, rematerialisation, holding, transfer, and pledge of securities in electronic form; and e-voting services to companies. Its Data Entry and Stroage segment provides centralized record keeping of KYC document of capital market investors. The Repository segment offers policyholders/warehouse receipt holders a facility to keep insurance policies/warehouse receipts in electronic form and to undertake changes, modifications, and revisions in the policy/receipt. It also provides account opening, processing delivery and receipt instructions, pledging, nomination, transmission of securities, change in address, bank account details, and SMS services for depository participants (DPs). In addition, the company offers various services, such as electronic access to security information, electronic access to security information and execution of secured transaction, SMS alerts related to transactions, electronic consolidated account statements, and virtual annual general meetings; Myeasi mobile application; application programming interfaces for DPs, electronic delivery instruction slip, and electronic margin pledge; and electronic foreign investment monitoring, electronic system driven disclosure services, and electronic notices, as well as e-locker services. Further, it provides KYC registration agency, eKYC, electronic signature service, tax filing, stamp duty calendar, electronic negotiable warehouse receipts and electronic non-negotiable warehouse receipts, and electronic insurance account. The company serves market participants, exchanges, clearing corporations, DPs, issuers, and investors. Central Depository Services (India) Limited was incorporated in 1997 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nehal Naleen Vora", "age": 52, "title": "CEO, MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 53532626, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Girish  Amesara", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajesh  Saraf", "title": "Chief Data & Operations Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Amit  Mahajan", "age": 52, "title": "Executive VP & CTO", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nilay Rajendra Shah", "title": "Compliance Officer & Company Secretary", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rajat  Srivastav", "title": "Senior Vice President & General Counsel", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Nayana  Ovalekar", "age": 55, "title": "Executive VP & Chief Regulatory Officer", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jitendra Panchal Chad", "title": "Senior Vice President of Information Technology", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vishwas  Nagle", "title": "Senior Vice President of Information Technolog